> That is good to know. I did not include the std.lv <http://std.lv> = TRUE argument, but I will try out whether this works out with stan then. And having a look into the prior is a good suggestion two. I already thought about specifying more informative priors to aid with covergence. So, maybe this will help, too.
> I will keep you posted, as soon as I get new results. Thanks for your effort.
